From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OAN Messaging <messaging@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:15:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sms): farmer SMS for the loan lifecycle through
 oan_messaging_connector

Queues one SMS per farmer event with oan_messaging_connector.queue_sms, inside the
business transaction (sent after commit; never blocks a loan action):

- application_submitted from submit_application;
- stage_changed, application_approved, application_rejected, loan_disbursed (only for
  a Disbursed stage) and application_completed from update_loan_status;
- visit_scheduled and visit_cancelled from A2C Visit Schedule doc_events, expiring
  when the visit starts.

Texts fit one SMS part at the longest field values and carry no amounts or staff
free text. A stage move on an already closed application sends only a late "paid out"; visit hooks never block the visit action. Adds oan_messaging_connector to required_apps and fetches it in CI (repository variable OAN_MESSAGING_CONNECTOR_REPO).
